&lt;td style=&quot;width: 75%; border-right: 1px solid #666; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;Certainly. As I said, the process is being handled by this old mystic. Guy is probably 83 years old, so he&#039;s clearly not using the EVE himself. I was thinking we hook up something similar to what you have in your chair, but simplify it to feed into a tree. Trees are easier than people, right? I was thinking we could probably set it up so we get 4 or 5 trees on one machine/subject.&lt;/td&gt;
