&lt;td style=&quot;width: 75%; border-right: 1px solid #666; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;I see. The potential sunk cost is a little higher than I anticipated, but I see that you&#039;ve included a line item for mass producing my EVE machine in addition to the anticipated R&amp;amp;D cost. How many of these are you expecting to need?&lt;/td&gt;
