&lt;td style=&quot;width: 75%; background-color: #f0f0f0; border-right: 1px solid #666; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;I am thinking we want to keep this operation fairly small. Fewer trees means fewer subjects each season. Fewer subjects means less loss in maintenance and &amp;quot;sundries&amp;quot;. Local law enforcement is pretty much federal, but the district chief&#039;s gonna need to be paid off. All told, I am factoring for a grove of 40 trees, so 20 active with 2 immediate replacements.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 10%; border-right: 1px solid #666; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;21:29&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 15%; border-right: 1px solid #666; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;R. Carter&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 75%; border-right: 1px solid #666; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;That sounds more than fair, but I want a stronger market analysis. Can you get a few flutes to the Hong Kong office by the first? We&#039;re having a fete for some of our more exclusive clientele. I&#039;d like to gauge their reactions personally.&lt;/td&gt;
