&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merlo:&lt;/strong&gt; Exactly! That&#039;s what we said! There was a guy here already, an American general, sipping cocktails and the whole-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navarro:&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;em&gt;Taking the telephone&lt;/em&gt;) It was Michael Flynn, Director. Michael Flynn was here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Light:&lt;/strong&gt; What was he doing there?&lt;/p&gt;
