&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navarro:&lt;/strong&gt; He was indisposed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Light:&lt;/strong&gt; I don&#039;t even know what to make of this. So did you get a chance to talk to the ambassador?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navarro:&lt;/strong&gt; I mean, sort of? Only insomuch that he recognized we were there, but every time we&#039;d try and bring up the election he&#039;d just sort of laugh and point to Flynn, and then they&#039;d both laugh, and then drink some more. It was really fucking weird. I could barely get a word in edgewise.&lt;/p&gt;
