&lt;p&gt;Congratulations Director Light! This is fantastic - a great step forward for both our organization and the United States as a whole! It&#039;s been an honor to serve in this mission with you, not just as a researcher but also as a patriot! While I&#039;ve got you on the phone, can you tell me why everyone seems so upset about this? As a centrist, I really find it important to see issues from both-&lt;/p&gt;
